+869d97fd00283960927b7cc0b79d5e620be1fddd,145,2025-09-24T16:41:05+05:30,5269,259,0,"feat(agents): stabilize agent SDK integrations and add deterministic intents\n\nIntroduce lightweight event dataclasses in core.agents.agent_sdk.events_models to standardize MarketTick, PriceProposal, and AlertEvent payloads across agents.\n\nMigrate several agents to use agent_sdk bus and protocol helpers (data_collector, alert_notifier, pricing_optimizer) to centralize messaging.\n\nAdd fallback shim for mcp.server.fastmcp so tools can register in environments without the optional dependency.\n\nBuffer LLM output and improve error messages (avoid non-ASCII emoji prints) and safer margin defaults when cost unavailable.\n\nAdd deterministic, fast-path intent handlers in UserInteractionAgent to answer common queries (cheapest, most_expensive, trending, pressure, stats) without invoking an LLM.\n\nUpdate .gitignore to include AGENTS.md and branch-diff helpers.\n\nThis commit focuses on runtime robustness and developer experience: safer prints for Windows consoles, deterministic assistants when LLM isn't available, and consistent agent event types for cleaner bus messaging."
